# Raiden Furina Kazuhaa Xilonen. ~20s Rot. Raiden Taser with Grouping, ODing on %DMG bonus; Raiden wants ATK Goblet. 2E Xilonen mostly Scrolls Electro. High Furina damage share, her C2 is better than Raiden's.

